===Etymology===
* (''Bernheze'') First attested as ''in de Bus'' in 1678. Derived from a dialectal variant of {{m|nl|bos|t=rising forest}}.
* (''Meierijstad'') First attested as ''hoeve genaemt in de bus'' in 1777. Derived from a dialectal variant of {{m|nl|bos|t=rising forest}}.

